{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/j6dwfqds","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":710.4,"top":187.2,"width":494.4,"height":403.2},"name":"Text 15","text":"The critic was untuned. Prompt exposure differed: 16 prompts × 8 completions for GRPO, against 128 prompts for PPO. The 200-token cap can still bind.\n\nOn the saturated 0.5B addition task both methods sit at 0.99. Paired difference −0.002, p = 0.374. A null at the ceiling cannot separate no effect from no headroom.\n\nG = 8 versus G = 2 on the unsaturated rerun is −0.005, interval crossing both zero and the ±0.02 equivalence margin.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":20,"typeface":"Calibri","color":"#3F3A36","alignment":"left"}}
